//! The DERIVED projection the UI renders — never a machine it runs. One
//! shape for both planes: this route serves the machine read model for
//! machine-bearing entities, and (when the entity also carries a Plane B
//! workflow config) the `/workflow` payload merges the same object. The
//! UI can never offer a transition the backend would 409: buttons render
//! from `available_transitions` only, and an unknown column value is
//! VISIBLE (`state_known = false`) with an empty edge set.

